		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Debutant = addition horizontale + verticale]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=33175#p33175"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />je suis débutant,<br />je n&#039;arrive pas à résoudre ce cas (probablement) simple d&#039;addition à la fois horizontale et verticale</p><p>La table (fictive)</p><p>- nom<br />- année<br />- mois<br />- montant 1<br />- montant 2</p><p>donc 1 ou 0 enregistrement par nom/annee/mois</p><br /><br /><p>Je voudrais faire un tableau :</p><p> </p><p>nom/année&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;montanti 1&#160; &#160; montant 2&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; montant total (1+2+)</p><p> <br />ex :</p><p>dupont<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2020&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 100&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;50&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;150<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2021&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 120&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;70&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;190</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;TOTAL&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 220&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 120&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 340</p><p>DURAND&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;2020&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;300&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;50&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;350<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2021&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;500&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 400&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 900</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; TOTAL&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;800&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;450&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 1250</p><br /><p>Total général&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 020&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 570&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1 590</p><br /><br /><p>Merci de votre aide</p><p>Cordialement</p>]]></content>
